{"title":"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> with right angle at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, altitude <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/e/20e8e26d580012b86d8fe55e70e5740908c35af0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CH$\" width=\"31\" height=\"12\" /> and median <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/3/fa38fd42cdaa5db0dd4e0f7df98ae79a598eb627.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CM$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"36\" height=\"14\" /> trisect the right angle. If the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/f/bff3fddc1d13f9c0ed2e61b43a5e1cfe95ef4694.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle CHM$\" width=\"66\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfb064112b6c94470339f6571f69d07afc1c024c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" />, then the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> is \n</p><p>\t<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/7/0d7eff3ba32ca74392649e03d1be810c521753cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 6K\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 4\\sqrt3\\ K\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 3\\sqrt3\\ K\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 3K\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 4K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"492\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/4/3a45dd36b054bcfa359d1bcad0cfb621388b4721.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] pair A=(-6,0),B=(6,0),C=(-3,5.196),M=(0,0),H=(-3,0); draw((-6,0)--(6,0)--(-3,5.196)--(-6,0)); draw((-3,5.196)--(0,0)); draw(C--H); dot(A); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,SW); dot(B); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,SE); dot(C); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,N); dot(M); label(&quot;$M$&quot;,M,S); dot(H); label(&quot;$H$&quot;,H,S);  markscalefactor=0.1; draw(anglemark((-6,0),C,(6,0))); draw((-3,0.5)--(-2.5,0.5)--(-2.5,0));  [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"135\" />\n</p><p>Draw diagram as shown (note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> can be interchanged, but it doesn’t change the solution).\n</p><p>Note that because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/3/fa38fd42cdaa5db0dd4e0f7df98ae79a598eb627.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CM$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"36\" height=\"14\" /> is a median, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/d/e5d9febca8a64de63e543edddd0be42f2120a1eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AM = BM$\" width=\"91\" height=\"13\" />.  Also, by ASA Congruency, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/e/8febfabdfa90a6cd631c62531fe82b39d478b4d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle CHA = \\triangle CHM$\" width=\"151\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/f/78f16b23ffff114140134a5885b8bf67c62b4368.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AH = HM$\" width=\"90\" height=\"13\" />.  That means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/1/ac1043bbdf0e749f409007a7502af48184cdf189.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$HM = \\tfrac{1}{4} \\cdot AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"114\" height=\"23\" />, and since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/f/bff3fddc1d13f9c0ed2e61b43a5e1cfe95ef4694.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle CHM$\" width=\"66\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> share an altitude, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/8/9a8dafdc9503caed98ceaacfcaa8927bb0d15465.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[ABC] = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 4K}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"147\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME\" title=\"1973 AHSME\">1973 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1973 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1973\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1973 AHSME Problems/Probl